# The Approval Desk needs no environment variables, credentials or provider accounts.
# There is no database: each Lab tab and each local stdio process owns a fresh in-memory
# queue seeded from fixtures/approvals.v1.json. Reload/restart resets every decision.
#
# The legacy Supabase variables of the earlier Confirm Queue source (VITE_SUPABASE_URL,
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, CONFIRM_ACTOR_ID) are not read by any
# active code. Do not set them for this app.
